                                "text": "Der Sitzriese zerriss den Zettel und warf die Papierfetzen in einen Bastkorb neben dem Tisch.",
                                "translation": "The seated seemingly tall man shredded the note and threw the paper scraps into a wicker rubbish bin next to the table.",
